 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1829863",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/39459a175a9c4b0bbbc99637c32378d7_1730183358082_d.jpg\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Greetings, Agents. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">In this patch, meet two Super Heroes in the desolate lands ruled by Super Villains.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Star-Lord</span> and <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Gamora</span>, who are trying to restore the reputation of the Guardians of the Galaxy have received new Uniforms.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated heroes</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">by downloading the 1/7 Patch!</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"color:#740060\">■ 1/7 Patch Details</span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Patch Schedule: 1/8 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 1/7 (Tue) 19:00 (PST)</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">[1/8&nbsp;(Wed) 2:41&nbsp;(UTC+0), 1/7&nbsp;(Tue) 18:41&nbsp;added]</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">The patch has been completed as of 1/8 (Wed) 2:41&nbsp;(UTC+0), 1/7 (Tue) 18:41&nbsp;(PST).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The game can still be accessed during the patch.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">When the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Two new Uniforms, Star-Lord &lt;Wastelanders&gt;, and Gamora &lt;Wastelanders&gt; have been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The skill effects of the Uniform are based on the maximum skill level stats.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The two new Uniforms will be on sale for</span></span> <span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">40% off during the &lt;Wastelanders Update Celebration Event&gt;</span></span></span> <span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">and can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the Event.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1736218308987\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ed54043347ce4597b02349309fa7c6c7_1736218308987_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" id=\"1736218318568\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/cd52daba645a48f98fa67970aca76412_1736218318568_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ New Uniform Collection</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Check out the new Uniforms of the Wastelanders theme.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Complete the collection by achieving the specified conditions and earn rewards.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1736217939672\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ada3cad80c674b6d8c3627d87ade7452_1736217939672_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900\">▣ Update Hot Deals Products </span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">‘Update Hot Deals’ products have been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\">- Event Schedule:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\">After the 1/7 Maintenance - 1/28 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0),</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\">After the 1/7 Maintenance - 1/28 (Tue) 6:59 (PST)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\">- The following products are available in the [Store] - [Update Hot Deals].</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The price is based on the Google Play Store.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">1. Hot Deal packs do not include 2025 New Year Holiday Tokens.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">2. The three packs below are sold individually.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">&lt;Hot Deal! Life Seed Pack / Hot Deal! Carbonadium Pack / Hot Deal! Soul of the Faltine Pack&gt;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">The [Purchase All Hot Deal! Tier-4 Upgrade Pack] allows you to purchase all three packs above at once.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">3. If you purchase one of the three individual packs first, you cannot purchase the [Purchase All Hot Deal! Tier-4 Upgrade Pack].</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1736217980715\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/baebd35812e54b5aa660960de48c578b_1736217980715_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1736218003715\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/3c1d05027d584b78b1795d13c124a46c_1736218003715_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1736218023770\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b69df9615ba74968845eeda8b44e039c_1736218023770_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1736218042623\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e2ea28fa0d254ee4b07e7e9f3d50d733_1736218042623_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" id=\"1736218092541\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/350c597220964abfa501fa9412400d18_1736218092541_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" id=\"1736218119103\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/9120e1ca15ff4375ad9d4087e9f7b3b3_1736218119103_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" id=\"1736218131078\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/07527abdd9d9488b8bb25699d0fc67d1_1736218131078_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\